{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/accc80fdf164cef264f56a82b6f9f6add320fe05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y,z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /> is a geometric sequence with common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74ddb8309acb92903e40f1ba96475de8f7761cdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f660828706dc697ed631b5bf5d4381cd0bb51b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, 2y, 3z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> is an arithmetic sequence, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a85cae37eb895894f7a9fb3c8b91f00fb4cb00c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"361\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84aba62df7be037107c1f1143ea9af12972af142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=xr, z=xr^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f660828706dc697ed631b5bf5d4381cd0bb51b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, 2y, 3z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> are an arithmetic sequence, there is a common difference and we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/5/575926ccb6186bdf2d65197025cd8320216c1273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2xr-x=3xr^2-2xr$\" width=\"170\" height=\"15\" />. Dividing through by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740f7ef780984ec360b4d42b1e890554b4fb687b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2r-1=3r^2-2r$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"138\" height=\"15\" /> or, rearranging, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e517b8f9b700998f8e6bfb69da630e80207de21c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(r-1)(3r-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" />. Since we are given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b0dc19d9e8a74b672ade24ab8b8088e133b4d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq y\\implies r\\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281aef6b09973e903b8468a12105e2c480294270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"58\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</